tation_ids":["cite.long.record-257bm-i-bridge"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.record-257bm-i-bridge"],"id":"long.record-257bm-i-bridge","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Theorem 6.107 (The support series as a coefficient series)","locator":"Long record Theorem 6.107, p. 75, label record:257bm-i-bridge","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*For $A\\subseteq\\mathbb{N}_{>0}$,\n$$\nX_A(2)=\\sum_{a\\in A}\\frac1{2^a-1}\n       =\\sum_{n\\ge1}\\frac{c_A(n)}{2^n}.\n$$\nExpanding each denominator as a geometric series and interchanging nonnegative sums gives the identity. Since $c_A(n)\\le\\tau(n)\\le n$, Theorem 6.105 applies. Together with Theorem 6.106, it expresses rationality through an integer recurrence whose coefficients all come from the same support.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/long.record-257bm-i-bridge","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/long.record-257bm-i-bridge","id":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-i-bridge%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.erdosSupportSeries_rational_iff_exists_temperedCarry%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-i-bridge%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.erdosSupportSeries_rational_iff_exists_temperedCarry%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/lean.Erdos249257.erdosSupportSeries_rational_iff_exists_temperedCarry"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/nodes/long.record-257bm-i-bridge","id":"sha256:57133a32273c39019ea3f4ba3de79281b7177858848a9345731e250a68a8c176/edges/%5B%22long.recor